["amend","task-1780487888",1780488099,"codex-worker",{"acceptance":["arm create --type unsupported-type exits non-zero with a clear error listing valid types","arm create --type bug --parent \u003cstory-id\u003e succeeds after hierarchy update","arm create --type bug --parent \u003ctask-id\u003e exits non-zero with hierarchy error","arm reparent --issue ID --parent STORY-ID succeeds and arm list shows updated parent","arm reparent --issue ID --parent \u003ctask-id\u003e exits non-zero with hierarchy error","make check green"],"definition_of_done":"arm create rejects invalid parent/type combinations at creation time with a clear error — no silent state corruption. Any type not recognized by the hierarchy rules (e.g. 'bug', 'feature') is rejected at creation time with an explicit error listing valid types; it does not silently pass through and corrupt the graph. The bug type is added to the valid hierarchy (epic and story can parent bug). A new arm reparent --issue ID --parent NEW-PARENT command moves an issue to a new parent, validating hierarchy before writing the op."}]
